about_trans:
in the "logistics and logistics system" module, we will study the contents of chapters 1 to 3: basic concepts of logistics, logistics management and supply chain management, and systematization of logistics;
the content of the "logistics functions" module (chapter 4~6) includes: the main functions of logistics, the auxiliary functions of logistics, and logistics information management;
the main contents of the "modern logistics management" module (chapter 7~10) include: logistics customer service; logistics cost management; logistics standardization; logistics organization;
in the "modern development of logistics" module (chapter 11~14), we will learn and understand the development of third-party and fourth-party logistics, express delivery business and services, cold chain logistics, and the logistics industry.

