about_trans:
introduce effective knowledge such as basic concepts, methods and research results in the field of human resource management;
provide a knowledge framework to help students understand, recognize and analyze human resource management issues in organizations and develop the ability to solve these problems;
by learning and mastering some specific methods and techniques of human resource management, students can continuously enrich their theoretical knowledge and continuously improve their practical ability in human resource management.

